{
    "key": "fitness",
    "templateKey": "repobot-fitness",
    "title": "Strength Club",
    "description": "A boutique strength studio's site in a strict black-and-white register: a live weekly class-schedule grid computed from one content file (today highlighted, a 'Next class / In session' badge derived from the clock), coach bios, month-to-month pricing tiers and class packs, and a free-week lead form — five pages, all edited in a single content file, art-directed in the chalk register (near-black rubber ground, chalk-bone signage type, hairline rules, high-contrast black-and-white photography).",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Strength studio site",
    "category": "fitness",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/fitness",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/Fitness",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The chalk register's overlay: mode dark opens the site in its native training-floor appearance (the appearance toggle still swaps to the daylight whiteboard-wall variant), and the register's chalk-on-black ink rides as the project brand so app-side surfaces wear the same monochrome register as the marketing pages instead of the kernel default blue. Brand values match the chalk preset's own light/dark accents — the marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so keeping them identical means the overlay re-brands the app without shifting the pages.",
        "mode": "dark",
        "brand": {
            "primary": "#181815",
            "primaryDark": "#f0eee7"
        }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests — the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it. The schedule is the signature slot: day/start/end are NUMBERS (weekday index and minutes since midnight) that the schedule engine computes the live badge and the grid from — a composer must bind them as numbers, never prose.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/Fitness/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "gym.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "gym.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "gym.city": { "kind": "text" },
            "gym.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "gym.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "gym.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "weeklySchedule": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 8,
                "item": {
                    "day": { "kind": "number" },
                    "start": { "kind": "number" },
                    "end": { "kind": "number" },
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "instructor": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "coaches": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "role": { "kind": "text" },
                    "bio": { "kind": "text" },
                    "photo": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "stats": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "value": { "kind": "text" },
                    "label": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "memberships": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "monthly": { "kind": "number" },
                    "yearlyPerMonth": { "kind": "number" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "features": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 3 }
                }
            },
            "classPacks": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "price": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "faq": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "question": { "kind": "text" },
                    "answer": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 1,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.hero": { "kind": "media" },
            "gallery": { "kind": "media[]", "min": 3 },
            "story.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "story.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "story.image": { "kind": "media" },
            "trial.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "trial.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
