        "$comment": "Doc-aware pack pages: routes maps each pack route to the page id its config merges under (web/app/src/View/Fitness/FitnessPage.tsx, useSitePageConfig). pages seeds each page's layout skeleton — ids match fitnessLanding.ts; the platform's structural editor edits these. The preset is chalk (the training-floor register: near-black rubber, chalk-bone stenciled signage, hairline rules, dust grain — strictly monochrome, the black-and-white photography carries all tone), deliberately apart from monolith's monumental tech statement and sitework's plan table.",
